      "writtenOn": "2020-08-27T15:44:02Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "The only place I see that this would make a difference is in handling DPM_REQUEST_PORT_DISCOVERY. That request is only made in pd_chipset_startup, so we probably should be clearing DPM requests as well as modal operation. I think keeping the clears together is OK.\n\nThere might be room in here for a function to collect various reset actions for the PE that always happen together, but I don\u0027t think that needs to happen now.",
      "parentUuid": "3f7f9869_8d4d2c6b",
      "revId": "af9b0a2cc1217addacc81dbf5f2dc09e2984be23",
